<report>
<title>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (2-sided Dwass-Steel-Chritchlow-Fligner)</title>
<p>Critical q (range) = @{q:roundu}</p>

<block name="dwass">
<table>
<tr><td>@t1 vs @t2</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>
<tr><td>(|@{wx:roundu}| > @{qval:roundu})</td><td><pval>@{p:pval}</pval></td></tr>
</table>
</block>
<br />

<p>
  <title>Kruskal-Wallis: all pairwise comparisons (2-sided Conover-Iman)</title><br />
Critical t (@{df:round0} df, @{sided:roundu}-sided) = @{t:roundu}
</p>

<block name="conover">
<table>
<tr><td>@t1 vs @t2</td><td><ci>@diff</ci></td></tr>

<tr>
  <td>(@{meanrank1:roundu} @compmeanrank @{meanrank2:roundu})</td>
    <td>
      <pval>@{p:pval}</pval>
    </td>
  </tr> 
</table>
</block>
</report>
